        "original_id": "c61bbd18-db6e-5256-a6c5-2a3e468b39bb",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Bands: Hinder, The Fatima Mansions\n- People: Austin Winkler, Joe \"Blower\" Garvey, Cody Hanson, Cathal Coughlan\n- Songs: \"Get Stoned\"\n- Albums: Lost in the Former West, \"Valhalla Avenue\"\n- Places: Oklahoma, Cork\n\nFacts:\n- The Fatima Mansions were an art rock group formed in 1988 by Cathal Coughlan, a singer and keyboardist from Cork who had previously been a member of Microdisney.\n- Hinder is an American rock band from Oklahoma that was formed in 2001 by lead singer Austin Winkler, lead guitarist Joe \"Blower\" Garvey, and drummer Cody Hanson.\n- \"Get Stoned\" is a song by the American rock band Hinder.\n- Lost in the Former West was the final album released by The Fatima Mansions.\n- Lost in the Former West continued the focus on hard-rock anthems that The Fatima Mansions had begun on \"Valhalla Avenue\".",
